---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Romantic Getaways: Big Island Edition";
const description = "Plan the perfect romantic escape on Hawaii's Big Island. Sunset dinners, secluded beaches, couples activities, and intimate experiences for your Hawaiian getaway.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="blog-post">
    <header class="post-header">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="category">Activities</span>
        <h1>{title}</h1>
        <p class="excerpt">Plan the perfect romantic escape on Hawaii's Big Island. From sunset dinners to secluded beaches, discover couples' experiences you'll never forget.</p>
        <time datetime="2026-02-01">February 1, 2026</time>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="lead">
          The Big Island of Hawaii offers endless opportunities for romance. Whether you're celebrating a honeymoon, anniversary, or simply escaping together, the island's diverse landscapes create the perfect backdrop for unforgettable moments.
        </p>

        <h2>Sunset Experiences</h2>
        <p>
          Nothing says romance like a Hawaiian sunset. The Big Island offers spectacular vantage points for watching the sun dip below the Pacific.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Kona Coast:</strong> The west side offers picture-perfect sunsets over the ocean</li>
          <li><strong>Mauna Kea:</strong> Watch sunset from above the clouds for a truly magical experience</li>
          <li><strong>Pololu Valley:</strong> Dramatic cliffs and wild coastline for adventurous couples</li>
          <li><strong>Kealakekua Bay:</strong> Combine a late-afternoon snorkel with sunset views</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Romantic Dining</h2>
        <p>
          The Big Island's culinary scene features everything from beachside casual to elegant fine dining.
        </p>

        <h3>Special Occasion Restaurants</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Brown's Beach House:</strong> Fine dining on the sand at the Fairmont Orchid</li>
          <li><strong>Merriman's:</strong> Farm-to-table Hawaiian Regional cuisine with ocean views</li>
          <li><strong>Roy's:</strong> Hawaiian fusion in a romantic Waikoloa setting</li>
          <li><strong>Huggo's on the Rocks:</strong> Waterfront dining in Kona with your feet in the sand</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Casual Romance</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cafe Pesto:</strong> Creative local cuisine in downtown Hilo</li>
          <li><strong>Moon and Turtle:</strong> Intimate dinner in Hilo's historic district</li>
          <li><strong>Beach picnics:</strong> Pick up local specialties and find your own secluded spot</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Secluded Beaches</h2>
        <p>
          Escape the crowds and find your own private paradise.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Makalawena Beach:</strong> A short hike leads to pristine white sand</li>
          <li><strong>Green Sand Beach:</strong> Adventure together to this rare olivine beach</li>
          <li><strong>Kiholo Bay:</strong> Turquoise lagoon perfect for swimming together</li>
          <li><strong>Kehena Beach:</strong> Secluded black sand beach (clothing optional)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Couples Activities</h2>

        <h3>Adventure Together</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Manta ray night swim:</strong> Share an unforgettable experience</li>
          <li><strong>Helicopter tour:</strong> See the island from above together</li>
          <li><strong>Waterfall hikes:</strong> Discover hidden cascades on the Hamakua Coast</li>
          <li><strong>Snorkeling at Captain Cook Monument:</strong> Pristine reef and marine life</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Relaxation</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Couples spa treatments:</strong> Side-by-side massages at resort spas</li>
          <li><strong>Stargazing:</strong> Romantic evening on Mauna Kea</li>
          <li><strong>Hot spring soak:</strong> Natural warm ponds in Puna district</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Special Touches</h2>
        <p>
          Make your trip extra special with these romantic additions:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Arrange a lei greeting upon arrival</li>
          <li>Book a private luau or dinner cruise</li>
          <li>Schedule a sunrise photo session</li>
          <li>Order tropical flower arrangements for your room</li>
          <li>Plan a surprise picnic on a secluded beach</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Best Time for Romance</h2>
        <p>
          While the Big Island is romantic year-round, consider these seasonal highlights:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>December-April:</strong> Whale watching season adds magic to coastal activities</li>
          <li><strong>May-September:</strong> Calmer seas and warmer weather for beach days</li>
          <li><strong>New moon nights:</strong> Best stargazing for astronomical romance</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="cta-box">
          <h3>Your Romantic Retreat Awaits</h3>
          <p>Island Goodes offers the perfect home base for your romantic Big Island escape. Our adults-only property ensures a peaceful, intimate atmosphere for couples.</p>
          <a href="https://v2.reservationkey.com/3655/reserve/c" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book Your Stay</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post-header {
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), url('/images/blog/romantic-getaway.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .post-header .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .category {
    background: var(--color-secondary);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .post-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    margin: 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .excerpt {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .post-header time {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .post-content {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .post-content .container {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .post-content .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .post-content h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .post-content h3 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .post-content p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .post-content ul, .post-content ol {
    margin: 1rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .post-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-box {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-box h3 {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-secondary);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #c49943;
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>
